SEC EDGAR filings
=================

Filings under data/10k/ are retrieved from the U.S. Securities and Exchange
Commission EDGAR system (https://www.sec.gov/). They are public company
disclosures.

Use of EDGAR data is subject to SEC terms and fair-access guidelines, including
a descriptive User-Agent with contact information on automated requests. This
project’s bootstrap script sends a descriptive User-Agent on those requests.

This repository does not claim copyright over SEC-hosted filing content.
